From 6068c1a26f84f8132de10f60b2bc0ce61568e085 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReliableEndo-GS Maintainers <dev@reliable-endo-gs.local>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix PyTorch 2.x AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND_HALF compatibility in sampler_kernel.cu

BUILD_API_COMPATIBILITY_ONLY
Target repository: https://github.com/princeton-vl/RAFT-Stereo
Target commit: 6068c1a26f84f8132de10f60b2bc0ce61568e085
Target file: sampler/sampler_kernel.cu

Rationale:
PyTorch 2.x deprecated and removed `Tensor.type()` returning dispatchable types in AT_DISPATCH macros.
Replacing `volume.type()` with `volume.scalar_type()` conforms to the modern ATen dispatch API (`at::ScalarType`).

Unchanged-science intent:
This change modifies strictly the dispatch macro operand. It does not alter CUDA kernel bounds checks,
indexing, thread geometry, float/half math, or return shapes.
The C++/Python binding interface remains strictly preserved:
  - forward(volume, coords, radius)
  - backward(volume, coords, grad_output, radius)

Runtime-equivalence requirement:
When a compatible GPU build toolchain and authorized checkpoint are available, the compiled extension
must be verified against the baseline mathematical specification for exact numerical equivalence.
---
 sampler/sampler_kernel.cu | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sampler/sampler_kernel.cu b/sampler/sampler_kernel.cu
index a8c634c..4fb9017 100644
--- a/sampler/sampler_kernel.cu
+++ b/sampler/sampler_kernel.cu
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ std::vector<torch::Tensor> sampler_cuda_forward(
   torch::Tensor corr = torch::zeros(
     {batch_size, 2*radius+1, ht, wd}, opts);
 
-  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND_HALF(volume.type(), "sampler_forward_kernel", ([&] {
+  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND_HALF(volume.scalar_type(), "sampler_forward_kernel", ([&] {
     sampler_forward_kernel<scalar_t><<<blocks, threads>>>(
       volume.packed_accessor32<scalar_t,4,torch::RestrictPtrTraits>(),
       coords.packed_accessor32<float,4,torch::RestrictPtrTraits>(),
@@ -154,7 +154,7 @@ std::vector<torch::Tensor> sampler_cuda_backward(
   const dim3 threads(BLOCK, BLOCK);
 
 
-  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND_HALF(volume.type(), "sampler_backward_kernel", ([&] {
+  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND_HALF(volume.scalar_type(), "sampler_backward_kernel", ([&] {
     sampler_backward_kernel<scalar_t><<<blocks, threads>>>(
       coords.packed_accessor32<float,4,torch::RestrictPtrTraits>(),
       corr_grad.packed_accessor32<scalar_t,4,torch::RestrictPtrTraits>(),
-- 
